stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SelectLanguage : Open Transcribe Page
    SelectLanguage --> StartRecording : Click Microphone
    StartRecording --> ProcessSpeech : Speak into Mic
    ProcessSpeech --> LivePreview : Web Speech API Translates
    LivePreview --> ProcessSpeech : Continue Speaking
    LivePreview --> StopRecording : Stop Microphone
    StopRecording --> EditTranscription : Manual Corrections (Optional)
    EditTranscription --> SaveArchive : Click 'Save to Archive'
    SaveArchive --> BackendValidation
    BackendValidation --> DatabaseStorage : Valid Data
    BackendValidation --> EditTranscription : Invalid Data (Missing fields)
    DatabaseStorage --> UpdateArchiveList
    UpdateArchiveList --> [*]
